    {
      "source": "This implementation clones all instance fields through standard\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Cloneable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Cloneable</code></a> support, allowing for subsequent reconfiguration\nof the cloned instance through a fresh <a href=\"#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\"><code>setBeanFactory(BeanFactory)</code></a> call.",
      "translation": "此实现通过标准的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Cloneable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Cloneable</code></a>支持克隆所有实例字段，允许通过新的<a href=\"#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\"><code>setBeanFactory(BeanFactory)</code></a>调用对克隆的实例进行重新配置。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
